<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ogiso dynasty</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Ogiso, Kings of the Sky</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Ogiso dynasty, whose name means Kings of the Sky, was the earliest ruling line of the Edo kingdom centred on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/benin-city">Ubini</a>, later <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/benin-empire">Benin</a> City. It governed for several centuries before losing legitimacy in a period of crisis. It was succeeded by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oba-dynasty">Oba dynasty</a>, which built the Benin Empire.</p></div>
